Coded the one row (Scott Wiener / healthcare) using SB 770's bill text and Senate vote page: both passages are the same instrument, `own-act`/`record`, on-question, in-term, but the operative sections (1001–1002) only direct a study and waiver-framework report rather than enact a financing system — so V4 shape is `study-directive` for both, and the row is BLANK `no-evidence` (Section 1000's single-payer-endorsing findings are recitals, not operative text, per the operative-section rule). File written to `labels/coder-3.json`.
